:''Not to be confused with [[Hatsuyume Mikan (PC Uber Rare Cat)]].''
'''Natsu Mikan''' was an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that is exclusive to the VIP First Anniversary Gacha, only available in the [[Minna de Nyanko Daisensou|PC version]].

