==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Nouryou Natsu Mikan''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
She has the long distance ability which allows her to take out enemies on the last hit of her attack but after the first hit, enemies have a chance to crawl in her blind spot as her last attack has a slightly drawn out attack animation, not to mention her long attack rate.

However, she is good at clearing peons and sniping the base. Because of her range, it's recommended you use her as support rather than as an attacker, although, if she is at level 30 it does not matter which form you use as stat wise, as they are identical.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller & Sniper}}

