==Trivia==
*The leaflets of the fronds in Mikan's icons are noticeably longer and thinner than the ones seen in her in-battle appearance.
*Nouryou Natsu Mikan has the absolute highest [[Long Distance]] reach of any Cat Unit, at 3,000.
*She is tied with [[Freshman Cat Jobs (Super Rare Cat)|Freshman Cat Jobs]] and [[Elder Flame Doron]] for having the strongest Weaken effect in the game, reducing unit damage to 1% of their original amount.
*This unit is likely a reference to Hatsune Miku, supported by the name and the 3939 cost. 39 is a symbol for Hatsune Miku.

